{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS7azoBJ14QiFtiFTLUy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not without sign-off from the security owner, and there's a second problem: the app has no due-date field.\n\n1. **The app has no due date.** `app/app.js:1` says: *\"A todo has: id, title, done, createdAt. No due date, no tags, no owner.\"* There's no field to attach a picker to. Adding due dates is a feature, so under this repo's flow it starts as an intent (`/write-intent`), then a spec, then a plan. It can't go straight into code.\n\n2. **A CDN library needs Khoa's sign-off.** `policy-security@1#S4` says: *\"No new external dependency (CDN script, library, web service) without sign-off from the security owner.\"* Khoa is the security owner. CLAUDE.md also says \"no npm dependency\", and a CDN script counts as an external dependency. I can't approve that myself.\n\n3. **We probably don't need a library at all.** The browser's built-in `<input type=\"date\">` already gives a date picker in every current browser, with no dependency and no sign-off. It also works offline and doesn't send anything to a third-party server, which fits a localStorage-only app. The main downside is that its look and date format follow the browser's locale, so we can't fully style it. If the team wants a custom look later, that's the point to take a specific library to Khoa.\n\n**My recommendation:** start an intent for \"due dates on todos\" with `/write-intent` and propose the built-in date input in it. When it reaches the spec stage, the spec can record the \"no new dependency\" decision against S4. If you still want a CDN library, I can draft the request to Khoa with the library name, version and size, and why the built-in input isn't enough.\n\nI've made no changes. Do you want me to start the `/write-intent`?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3245,"cache_read_input_tokens":37793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3245},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efedb415-c9fa-4bdc-8b6a-9081f5f88bd2","uuid":"c7992124-afbb-4bd1-b677-724d49b40efe","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:31:14.063Z","request_id":"req_011CgS7azSrLEJt5VHnBu2vY"}
